        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>③＋⑨自ら埋立処分又は海洋投入処分した量</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
